WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.458
Unit twelve. Coughs, Colds and Flu!

2
00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:08.624
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:12.122
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.172 --> 00:00:16.504
Today we learn about Coughs, Colds and Flu. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.366 --> 00:00:20.666
Cold. Say it with me. Cold!

6
00:00:24.166 --> 00:00:27.099
Flu. Say it with me. Flu!

7
00:00:30.601 --> 00:00:34.167
Virus. Say it with me. Virus!

8
00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:40.930
Cough. Say it with me. Cough!

9
00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:47.896
Fever. Say it with me. Fever!

10
00:00:51.448 --> 00:00:54.815
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

11
00:00:58.256 --> 00:01:01.990
Fluids. Say it with me. Fluids!

12
00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:09.223
Handwashing. Say it with me. Handwashing!

13
00:01:12.729 --> 00:01:22.668
Colds and flu are caused by a virus. They can cause cough, fever, and tiredness. Rest, fluids, and handwashing help, and antibiotics do not cure a virus.

14
00:01:22.718 --> 00:01:24.074
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.675 --> 00:01:30.803
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.853 --> 00:01:32.003
Virus!

17
00:01:32.941 --> 00:01:38.180
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:39.380
Fluids!

19
00:01:40.325 --> 00:01:47.096
Did you know? Antibiotics kill bacteria, not viruses — that is why they do not cure colds!

20
00:01:47.146 --> 00:01:49.540
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.725 --> 00:01:58.965
Think and answer. Why don't antibiotics help a cold?

22
00:01:59.015 --> 00:02:00.200
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.281 --> 00:02:06.027
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.077 --> 00:02:08.586
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

